    <diagram id="2xBWpHkCxMEZgLnsMJws" name=" Diagrama de sequência 3: Atualizar status do contrato">
        <mxGraphModel dx="2784" dy="181" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Diagrama de Sequência — Atualizar status do contrato\n\nautonumber\n\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontName Arial\nskinparam sequenceMessageAlign center\n\nskinparam sequence {\n  ArrowColor #34495E\n  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8\n  ParticipantBorderColor #2471A3\n  ActivationBackgroundColor #D6EAF8\n  ActivationBorderColor #2471A3\n}\n\nactor \&quot;Cliente ou\\nprofissional\&quot; as usuario\nboundary \&quot;Aplicativo\&quot; as app\ncontrol \&quot;ContractsController\&quot; as controller\ncontrol \&quot;ContractsService\&quot; as service\ncontrol \&quot;ContractStatusPolicyService\&quot; as policy\nparticipant \&quot;NotificationsService\&quot; as notifications\ndatabase \&quot;PrismaService / MySQL\&quot; as prisma\n\nusuario -&gt; app : Selecionar novo status\nactivate app\n\napp -&gt; controller : PATCH /api/contracts/:id/status\\n{ status, note? } + JWT\nactivate controller\n\nnote over controller\n  JwtAuthGuard autentica o usuário.\n  ValidationPipe valida o DTO.\nend note\n\ncontroller -&gt; service : updateStatus(user.id, id, dto)\nactivate service\n\nservice -&gt; service : getVisibleContract(userId, id)\nactivate service\n\nservice -&gt; prisma : contract.findUnique({ where: { id } })\nactivate prisma\nprisma --&gt; service : contract ou null\ndeactivate prisma\ndeactivate service\n\nalt Contrato inexistente ou usuário não participante\n  service --&gt; controller : NotFoundException / ForbiddenException\n  controller --&gt; app : Resposta de erro\n  app --&gt; usuario : Exibir motivo\n\nelse Contrato acessível\n  service -&gt; service : Determinar actor e hasReview\n\n  service -&gt; policy : assertCanTransition(context)\n  activate policy\n  policy --&gt; service : Permissão ou erro de transição\n  deactivate policy\n\n  alt Transição negada\n    service --&gt; controller : Erro com motivo da rejeição\n    controller --&gt; app : Resposta de erro\n    app --&gt; usuario : Exibir motivo\n\n  else Transição permitida\n    group prisma.$transaction(async tx =&gt; ...)\n      service -&gt; prisma : tx.contract.update({ status: dto.status })\n      activate prisma\n      prisma --&gt; service : Contrato atualizado\n      deactivate prisma\n\n      service -&gt; prisma : tx.contractStatusHistory.create(...)\n      activate prisma\n      prisma --&gt; service : Histórico registrado\n      deactivate prisma\n\n      service -&gt; notifications : create(dados, tx)\n      activate notifications\n      notifications -&gt; prisma : tx.notification.create(...)\n      activate prisma\n      prisma --&gt; notifications : Notificação registrada\n      deactivate prisma\n      notifications --&gt; service : Confirmação\n      deactivate notifications\n    end\n\n    alt Transação confirmada\n      service --&gt; controller : Contrato atualizado\n      controller --&gt; app : HTTP 200 + contrato\n      app --&gt; usuario : Exibir novo status\n    else Falha na transação\n      service --&gt; controller : Erro; alterações desfeitas\n      controller --&gt; app : Resposta de erro\n      app --&gt; usuario : Exibir falha\n    end\n  end\nend\n\ndeactivate service\ndeactivate controller\ndeactivate app\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="rWEpKkLqzVn7tTVq1svi-77">
                    <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
                        <mxGeometry x="-827" y="1169" as="geometry"/>
                    </mxCell>
                </UserObject>
